; Gloam Veil, returned on Aegis Ward's rules (in-flight item 9). BaseDamage is the tear's lash,
; and BaseRange is HOW FAR THE WIZARD MUST WALK to weave a torn veil back - the spell's cadence
; is distance, not time (scripts/GloamVeil.cs), so its Range lines level the walk DOWN and
; Player.BuildSpellUpgradeSummary words them as a share, never a distance. BaseCooldown is only
; the refresh tick that keeps its stats current.

